                                "sense_id": "b313e55c-00b0-3331-9319-42673f1f171d",
                                "text": "I've hearn some folks pretend that it comes from the bowels of the airth, but it don't; its^([sic]) a thing of the air, and I've a notion it travels a mighty long way from its startin' place afore it reaches us. \""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8ab18c1a-1f79-4cc8-ae0c-1448322723a6",
                                "sense_id": "b313e55c-00b0-3331-9319-42673f1f171d",
                                "text": "\"As I was tellin' ye,\" he said, \"I allers loved fishin' an' knowed 't was the best thing in the hull airth."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ab1333f4-7009-43d1-8e78-4fb8e0bdb1e2",
                                "sense_id": "b313e55c-00b0-3331-9319-42673f1f171d",
                                "text": "I guess there ain't nothin' on airth he loves better 'n that holler piece o' wood, and the toons that's inside o' it."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
